Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
 arch/mips/dts/Makefile                        |   1 +
 .../dts/econet,en751221-nokia_g240g-e.dts     | 149 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../dts/econet,en751221-reference-u-boot.dtsi |  56 -------
 arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221.dtsi            |   5 +
 arch/mips/mach-econet/Kconfig                 |   1 -
 configs/en751221_nokia_g240g-e_defconfig      |  92 +++++++++++
 configs/en7512_reference_defconfig            |   1 -
 7 files changed, 247 insertions(+), 58 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/mips/dts/econet,en751221-nokia_g240g-e.dts
